# B-361: Unknown function annotation key should emit a warning.
# fn@[return: Int foo: "bar"] — foo is not a valid fn annotation key.
[f: [fn@[return: Int  foo: "bar"] [let x@Int] x]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x)})
=== warn
unknown function annotation key 'foo' (valid keys: return, constraint, doc, bind, kinds)
